  "worked_solution": "In the case of negative linear dependence, the points on the plot should be scattered along a line with a negative slope.\n\nAmong the given options, the only scatter plot that fits the description is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14226611/assets/49578cc58c94128c3e77a36e14b67343dfcf8d402202736edbd802c673909b39.png)",
