  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-134880\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>In the case of negative linear dependence, the points on the plot should be scattered along a line with a negative slope.</p>\n<p>Among the given options, the only scatter plot that fits the description is the following:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-134880-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-134880-e-0\"></div></div>",
